[Lemma lem.DiskAnnulus of arXiv:2609.01189, 'The lower mean curvature bound in Gromov's mean-of-the-mean-curvature conjecture'] For the metric $h$ with constant curvature $K_h\equiv-c^2$, we have
\begin{equation}
  \Big|\int_{\partial X}\kappa_h\Big|
  \leq
  \sqrt{4\pi^2\chi^2+c^2L^2} .
\end{equation}

