[Theorem lem:recursiveLemmaFormula of arXiv:2509.16694, 'A central limit theorem for two-dimensional directed polymers with critical spatial correl'] For all $a>-1$, $z\in \big[\,0,\,(a+2)z_a/2\,\big)$ and $x\in [0,1]$,
\begin{equation} 
    \begin{split}
\sum_{k=0}^\infty   f_k(x) z^{2k}  =   \frac{ \tilde J_{\alpha}\left(\frac{2}{a+2}\,z  x^{\frac{a+2}{2}} \right)}{\tilde J_{\alpha}\left(\frac{2}{a+2}\,z\right)}.
\end{split}
\end{equation}

