Moreover, for each $x\in L^2$, the process $[s,T]\ni t\mapsto U(t,s)x\in L^2(\mathbb{R}^d)$ is continuous and $(\mathcal{F}_t)_{t\ge s}$-adapted, hence progressively measurable with respect to the filtration $(\mathcal{F}_t)_{t\ge s}$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

