[Lem CM mom UB of arXiv:2608.25471, 'Exact Hausdorff measures and fine geometry of collisions of independent Markov processes'] For any $r \in (0, e^{-1} \wedge r_*)$, $n \in \mathbb{N}$, and $t \in (0, \infty)$,
  \begin{equation}
    \sup_{\bm{x} \in M^k} \sup_{y \in M}
    \hat{E}_{\bm{x}}\!\left[\Pi_t(B(y, r))^n\right]
    \leq 
    \begin{cases}
      n!\, \bigl( \tilde{c}(t)\, r^{d_{\mathrm{cp}}} \bigr)^n,& \text{if}\quad \hat{d}_{\mathrm{s}} > 2,\\
      n!\, \bigl( \tilde{c}(t)\, r^{d_{\mathrm{f}}} \log(1/r) \bigr)^n,& \text{if}\quad \hat{d}_{\mathrm{s}} = 2.
    \end{cases}
  \end{equation}

