[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2609.02017, 'Optimal girth-dependent bounds for the Bethe approximation of the permanent'] The function $\varphi$ is an $\mathbf s$--$\mathbf t$ flow on
$\mc{N}$. Its value is
\begin{equation}

\operatorname{val}(\varphi)
=
\sum_{e\in E}(\mathsf J_e^+-\mathsf J_e^-)
=
\frac12\sum_{v\in V}
  (\mathsf J_v^+-\mathsf J_v^-).
\end{equation}

