[Lemma lem::scaling of arXiv:2411.01467, 'Conformal covariance of connection probabilities \\ in the 2D critical FK-Ising model'] For any $0<r<R$, we have 
	\begin{align*}
		\lim_{a\to 0 } \frac{\mathbb{P}^a_{\mathbb{Z}^2}\left[0\longleftrightarrow \partial B_{R}(0)\right]}{\mathbb{P}^a_{\mathbb{Z}^2}\left[0\longleftrightarrow \partial B_r(0)\right]} =\Big(\frac{r}{R}\Big)^{\frac{1}{8}}. 
	\end{align*}

