[Lemma cneinveineonevni of arXiv:2608.30443, 'On smooth holosphere solutions to compressible Euler equation'] Let $M(x)$ be holomorphic in a neighborhood of $0$, then there exists $c_M>0$ such that for all functions $\Phi$ which are $C^\infty$ at the origin, 
