            \le C_R\,\norm{\flap u}_{L^p(\R^n)},
            \qquad\forall\,u\in C_{\mathrm{c}}^\infty(B_R^c).
        \end{equation}
    \end{itemize} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

[Proposition of arXiv:2411.09257, 'Iterated Generalized Counting Process and its Extensions'] For $|u|\le1$, the pgf $\hat{G}^q(u,t)$ of $q$-iterated GCP is given by
