\end{align*}
where $f^\Vec$ is the unique viscosity solution of~\eqref{e.hj} with initial condition $f^\Vec(0,\cdot)=\psi^\Vec$ given in~\eqref{e.psi^Vec=}. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

