[Theorem thm:block-counting-convergence of arXiv:2507.12601, 'Multi-type logistic branching processes with selection: frequency process and genealogy fo'] {\emph{(At carrying capacity, backward in time)}}
Let $(A_K(t))_{t \in [0,T]}$ be the lineage counting process introduced above and let $\left(A(t)\right)_{t \in [0,T]}$ be the continuous time Markov process with transitions
