	  X_i(t,a)\geqslant a + t u_{0,i}(a) \geqslant a-tM,
\end{equation*}
because the double integral in \eqref{charX} is nonnegative.  
Their images of $(-\infty,a]$ therefore contain $(-\infty,a-tM]$, which proves
\eqref{domain}.  
