[Corollary 29 (Strict positivity and normalized hitting identity) of arXiv:2607.19752, 'Weak Equilibrium Measures and Capacity--Hitting Identities\\ for the Hypoelliptic Third-Or'] Under the hypotheses of Theorem~\ref{thm:hitting},
\[
    0<\Cap_\eps(A,B;\calD)<\infty.
