      \mathsf{P}_{n}\bigl( c_{n}^{-1}\nu_{n}(B_{R_{n}}(\rho_{n}, a_{n})) < \delta \bigr) > \eta
    \bigr)
    = 0,
    \quad 
    \forall \eta > 0.
  \end{equation}

[Theorem thm_volume of arXiv:2412.05706, 'Quasi-multiplicativity and regularity for metric graph Gaussian free fields'] For any $3\le d\le 5$, there exists a constant $
