[Corollary 33 of arXiv:2604.09933, 'Explicit cutoff profiles for colored top-\texorpdfstring{$m$}{m}-to-random shuffles'] For every \(1\le m\le n\), \(k\ge0\), and \(x\in G_{n,p}\),
\begin{equation}
\frac{(Q^{(m)})^{*k}(x)}{U(x)}
=\sum_{u=0}^{L_p(x)}P_k^{(m)}(u)\,u!\,p^u.
\end{equation}

