[Proposition 4 of arXiv:2608.22112, '2608.22112'] The RMSE between a trajectory generated by the actual model and a trajectory generated by an estimated model gives an upper bound on the $\ell^2$ error between the averages of those trajectories:
\begin{equation}
\|\bm \mu - \tilde{\bm \mu}\|_2
\le
\mathrm{RMSE}.
\end{equation}

