    $$\tau_n =  \inf \{t \in [0,T] : \|X(t)\| \geq n\} \wedge T,$$
    and consider the truncated process $X^n(t) = X(t \wedge \tau_n)$ for $t \in [0,T]$. Then $X^n$ satisfies the SDE
    \begin{equation*}
        X^n(t) = X(0) + \int_{0}^{t} b(s, X^n_{[0,s]}) \Ind_{\{s \leq \tau_n\}} \, ds + \int_{0}^{t} \sigma(s,X^n_{[0,s]}) \Ind_{\{s \leq \tau_n\}} \, dW(s), \quad t \in [0,T].
    \end{equation*}
