[Lemma continuous-to-discrete of arXiv:2606.25135, 'Convergence Rates for Semistochastic Processes'] Let $\pi$ denote the stationary distribution for a continuous-time Markov process $\{X_t\}$  with Markov semigroup \, $\mathcal{U}^t$ and let $\Delta t > 0$ be a fixed time increment.  
