[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2606.24599, '\bf Perron--Frobenius theorem for a general tree-valued growth-fragmentation-isolation pro'] The limiting distribution $\pi$ satisfies
        \begin{align}

            \Lb^*\pi=\lab\pi,\qquad \langle\pi,|\cdot|^2\rangle<+\infty,
        \end{align}
        and $\pi(\tt) > 0$ for all $\tt \in \TT$.

