[Lemma lem:limitL of arXiv:2601.19630, 'Mass generation for the two dimensional O(N) Linear Sigma Model in the large N limit'] For $m$ and $m_{*}$ defined by the equations (equation e91 of the paper) and (equation e127 of the paper) respectively, the following inequality holds
\begin{equation}
\limsup_{L \to \infty} \frac{1}{L^{2}} W_{H_{m}^{1}(\Lambda_{L})^{N} }(\mu_{m_{*},L }^{\otimes N}, \mu_{m,L}^{\otimes N} )^{2} \lesssim \lambda  |\ln m_{*}| \cdot \frac{1}{N}  . 
