[Lemma 22 of arXiv:2608.30551, 'Critical Discrete Hardy Inequalities in $L^p$'] Let $r, s \in (0, 1)$ and $N \in \N$. Then 
\begin{equation}
\sum_{j=1}^N
\frac{1}{j^r(N+1-j)^s}
\lesssim
N^{1-r-s}.
\end{equation}

