\eqn{eq:n>=2error}{
  \sum_{N=2}^{\infty} \sum_{N'=0}^\infty \Psi^{N,N'}(F;u,x')
  \le C_W T(o,u,x'). }
(ii) There is a constant $C_W$ such that for all $v'$, 
