Assuming the mechanism computes the mean using the respective dataset sizes, the true, un-noised mean vectors and their difference are:
\begin{align*}
\mu_z = \frac{1}{N_t} \sum_{x \in Z_{t}} x, \quad
\mu_{-z} = \frac{1}{N_t-1} \sum_{x \in Z_{t} \setminus \{z\}} x, \quad
\mu_z - \mu_{-z}
