[Lemma lem: TrivialCoker_pbetaWithoutSym of arXiv:2603.26932, 'On the satisfaction frequency of spectral characterization conditions'] Let $q \de p^{\operatorname{deg}(\beta)}$. 
    Then, for every $n\geq 1$, 
    \begin{align}
       \Bigl\lvert\, \bbP\bigl( \coker(\bM_{p,\beta}, \zeta_{p,\beta}) \cong 0\bigr) -  \prod_{i=2}^\infty\Bigl(1- \frac{1}{q^i}\Bigr) \,  \Bigr\rvert \leq  \frac{3}{q^n}. 
    \end{align}

