$$
has probability $1-O((\log n)^{-1})$.

[Lem closure of arXiv:2608.29018, 'Sharp Restricted Isometry Thresholds for\\ Global Minima of Rank-Restricted Matrix LASSO'] Under the same conditions as \lemref{head-controls}.
If 
\begin{equation}
\lambda\ge2\frac{1+\rho_{\delta,t}}{1-\rho_{\delta,t}}\lambda_{0},
\end{equation}
 then \begin{subequations}
\begin{align}
\normtwo{A\sigma} & \le\frac{4\tau_{\delta,t}}{1-\rho_{\delta,t}}\sqrt{r_{\star}}\,\lambda,\\
\normtwo{\sigma} & \le\frac{16\tau_{\delta,t}^{2}}{(1-\rho_{\delta,t})^{2}}\sqrt{r_{\star}}\,\lambda.
