[Proposition prop_8 of arXiv:2412.03774, '{ Refining Concentration for \\Gaussian Quadratic Chaos with\\ Applications in Sonar and C'] Let $\lambda_1,\cdots, \lambda_k$ be as in ((poloi_1 of the paper)). If
\begin{eqnarray}

t+b_k\ge\frac{\sum_{i=k+1}^n \lambda_i^2}{a_k},
\end{eqnarray}
then 
\begin{eqnarray}

\Pr(\boldsymbol{\Delta}>t)\leq e^{-\frac{\kappa(t+b_k)}{a_k}}\prod_{i=1}^k \Big(2\kappa\frac{- \lambda_i}{a_k}+1\Big)^{-\frac{1}{2}},
\end{eqnarray}
where $a_k, b_k$ are given in ((a_k_b_k of the paper)) and $\kappa$ is given in ((HW_constant of the paper)).

