[Proposition 34 (Sobolev, Step 4.d)) of arXiv:2605.28677, 'Weak universality for stochastic reaction-diffusion models\\ with long-range correlated no'] Let $[\beta]\geq0$ and assume that $\eqref{Pi-_recentre}_\beta$, $\eqref{est_deltaPi-_bounded}_\beta$ and $\eqref{est_deltaPi-_inc}_\beta$ hold,
