and that $\eqref{est_Pi-}_{\beta'}$ and $\eqref{est_deltaPi-}_{\beta'}$ hold for all populated $\beta'\prec\beta$.
Then 

\begin{equation}
\EE^\frac{1}{q} \left|
\delta\Pi_{x\beta t}^-(y) \right|^q
\lesssim \ve^{|\beta|-\langle\beta\rangle}
\big(\sqrt[4]{t}\big)^{\alpha-2} (\sqrt[4]{t}+|x-y|)^{\langle\beta\rangle-\alpha} \w \, .
\end{equation}

