[Corollary cor:coherent-gmc-lines of arXiv:2608.02459, 'Response Calculus for Spectral Simplicity\\ and Joint Eigenvalue Densities'] The family (equation eq:coherent-line-gmc of the paper) satisfies
\begin{equation*}
 M_{x,\tau}^{f}
 =e^{\gamma(\tau-r)f}M_{x,r}^{f},
 \qquad r,\tau\in\mathbb R.
\end{equation*}
For the coordinate GFF $h$ and every fixed $\tau\in\mathbb R$,
\begin{equation}
 M_{h,\tau}^{f}=M_{h+\tau f}
 \qquad\text{almost surely}.
\end{equation}

