[Theorem thm:PP conv of arXiv:2607.01946, 'Second-order fluctuations for a phase transition in random partitions'] For $(p_n = P_n^\downarrow)_{n\in{\mathbb N}}$ from the $(\alpha,\theta)$-partitions (i.e., as in (equation eq:p_n CRP of the paper)), we have
\begin{equation}
\xi_n\stackrel{a.s.w.}\to \xi\stackrel{d}{=}{\rm PPP}\pp{{\mathbb R}\times{\mathbb R}\times[0,\infty),\mu_\alpha({\rm d} x){\rm d} y e^{-z}{\rm d} z}, \end{equation}
with respect to ${\mathcal P}$ as $n\to\infty$ in $\mathcal{M}_p({\mathbb R}\times{\mathbb R}\times[0,\infty))$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

