body:
[Lemma 5 (Pair-square expansion of $H_C$) of arXiv:2605.26107, 'Radial Extremality for LRU Caching and the Fill--Holst Conjecture'] For every $p\in\Delta_N^\circ$,
\begin{equation}
        H_C(p)
        =
        \frac{C}{N}
        +
        \sum_{1\le a<b\le N}(p_a-p_b)^2J_{ab}^{(C)}(p),
\end{equation}
where
\begin{equation}
        J_{ab}^{(C)}(p)
        =
        \sum_{\substack{R\subseteq[N]:\ \{a,b\}\subseteq R\\ \card R\ge L}}
        (-1)^{\card R-L}
        \binom{\card R-2}{\card R-L}
        \frac{1}{\card R\,p_R}.
\end{equation}

