[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2604.01701, '\bf Chung-type laws of the iterated logarithm for $m$-fold weighted integrated fractional '] Let $T:\mathcal{H}\to E$ be an operator mapping a Hilbert spaces into a Banach space and suppose that $\sum_{i=1}^{\infty} g_iTf_i$ convergence a.s. in $E$. Let $\alpha\in(0,2)$. If  
