  (ass:standing of the paper) with \(r\geqslant 2\). Let \(A>0\). There exists \(\sigma_0>0\) and a function
  \(\mathscr E_{\mathrm{in}}\) from the class \(\mathfrak B_{r-2}\) on \(\mathcal D_{A,\mathcal{K}_{
  \mathcal{S}}, \sigma_0}\) such that
  \begin{align}
    I_\sigma(a,x) &= \mathsf C_0(a,x) + \sigma\mathsf C_1(a,x)
