[Lemma 8 (W5 implies the triangular-array fourth-moment Lindeberg bound) of arXiv:2608.07820, 'Linear Spectral Statistics for Entrywise-Transformed Spiked Wigner Matrices under Shifted '] Assume \eqref{eq:W5-package}.  Let \(s_{e,N}\), \(1\le e\le M_N\), be any
triangular array satisfying
\begin{equation}
 \max_{1\le e\le M_N}|s_{e,N}|\longrightarrow0.
\end{equation}
Then, for every \(\varepsilon>0\),
\begin{equation}
 \max_{1\le e\le M_N}
 \E\left[
 |Y_{s_{e,N}}|^4
 \one_{\{|Y_{s_{e,N}}|>\varepsilon\sqrt N\}}
 \right]
 \longrightarrow0.
\end{equation}
In particular,
\begin{equation}
 \frac1{M_N}\sum_{e=1}^{M_N}
 \E\left[
 |Y_{s_{e,N}}|^4
 \one_{\{|Y_{s_{e,N}}|>\varepsilon\sqrt N\}}
 \right]
