\end{equation}

[Lem 26 of arXiv:2604.07370, 'Probabilistic Weyl law for twisted Toeplitz matrices with rough symbols'] Let $\chi$ and $\beta$ be as above. Then, under the assumptions of Theorem \ref{Théorème central}, we have
