[Corollary coro:order-interval-metric-equivalence of arXiv:2411.01364, 'Global Dynamics of Granular Media Equations via Stochastic Order'] Let $[\mu,\nu]$ be an order interval and $\{\rho_n\}_{n\geq1}\subset[\mu,\nu]$, $\rho\in[\mu,\nu]$. Then the following convergences are equivalent.
\begin{enumerate}[label=\textnormal{(\roman*)}]
\item $\mathcal W_2(\rho_n,\rho)\to0$ as $n\to\8$;
\item $\mathcal W_p(\rho_n,\rho)\to0$ as $n\to\8$, for all $1\leq p<2$;
\item $\rho_n\to\rho$ weakly as $n\to\8$.
\end{enumerate}

