[Lemma LEM:AEC of arXiv:2512.23957, 'Concentration and fluctuations of sine-Gordon measure around topological multi-soliton man'] Let $F$ be a bounded, continuous function and $\delta_\varepsilon=\eta\sqrt{\varepsilon \log \frac 1\varepsilon}$, defined in (equation LDPIN2 of the paper). Then
\begin{align*}
\mathbb{E}_{ \nu^\perp_{ \xi_1,\dots,\xi_k } }\Big[F(v) e^{\frac 1\varepsilon \mathcal{E}_{\xi_1,\dots,\xi_k}(v)  } \textup{Det}_{\xi_1,\dots,\xi_k}(\sqrt{\varepsilon}v), \, A_\varepsilon^c, \, \| \sqrt{\varepsilon}v \|_{L^2} < \delta_\varepsilon   \Big] \lesssim e^{-c K^2 |\log L_\varepsilon| },
\end{align*}

\noindent
uniformly in $\xi_1, \dots,\xi_k \in [-\overline L_\varepsilon, \overline L_\varepsilon]^k $, where  $\mathcal{E}_{\xi_1,\dots,\xi_k}$ and $\textup{Det}_{\xi_1,\dots,\xi_k}$ are defined in Proposition (PROP:cha of the paper).

