body:
[Definition Decision factorization of arXiv:2608.23860, 'Revelation Control'] For $\mathscr H\subseteq\mathscr G$, the $\mathscr G$-optimal decision \emph{factorizes through} $\mathscr H$ if there exists an $\mathscr H$-measurable policy $\pi_H$ satisfying
\begin{equation}
\pi_H(\omega)\in\arg\max_{a\in\mathcal A}\mathbb E[Q_a\mid\mathscr G](\omega)
\quad\text{a.s.}
\end{equation}
The definition concerns the action-relevant quotient of the refined information, not reconstruction of the full latent state.

